## Choosing the Right Control Flow

### Decision Tree

```
Need to make a choice?
├─ Simple yes/no → if/else
├─ Multiple specific values → match
├─ Range-based buckets → match with ranges
└─ Complex conditions → if/elif/else

Need to repeat something?
├─ Known number of times → for with range
├─ Processing each item in a list → for item in list
├─ Unknown number (condition-based) → while
└─ Run until explicitly stopped → while true + break
```

### If/Elif/Else Cheatsheet

```xiom
// Single condition
if score >= 60 { io.println("Pass"); }

// Two-way branch
if valid { io.println("OK"); } else { io.println("Error"); }

// Multi-way
if score >= 90 { io.println("A"); }
elif score >= 80 { io.println("B"); }
else { io.println("Retry"); }

// As expression
let status = if active { "on" } else { "off" };
```

### While Cheatsheet

```xiom
// Counted
var i = 0;
while i < 10 { i += 1; }

// Condition-driven
while fuel > 0 { fuel -= burn_rate; }

// Infinite with exit
while true {
  if done { break; }
}

// Skip iteration
while condition {
  if skip { continue; }
}
```

### For Cheatsheet

```xiom
// Range
for i in 0..10 { process(i); }

// Collection
for item in items { process(item); }

// Nested
for row in 0..3 {
  for col in 0..3 { process(row, col); }
}
```

### Match Cheatsheet

```xiom
// Simple matching
match value {
  1 => "one",
  2 => "two",
  _ => "other",
}

// With |
match value {
  1 | 2 | 3 => "small",
  _ => "other",
}

// With ranges
match score {
  90..101 => "A",
  80..90 => "B",
  _ => "F",
}

// With guards
match n {
  x if x < 0 => "negative",
  x if x > 0 => "positive",
  _ => "zero",
}
```

### Quick Guide

| Situation | Tool |
|-----------|------|
| True/false decision | `if`/`else` |
| Multiple conditions | `if`/`elif`/`else` |
| Value-based dispatch | `match` |
| Counted repetition | `for i in 0..N` |
| Item processing | `for item in list` |
| Condition loop | `while` |
| Infinite loop | `while true` |
| Early exit | `break` |
| Skip iteration | `continue` |

